2: //!
3: //! Phase 1 ships only `/cluster/info` — the standalone-vs-raft probe the
4: //! Xerj Console SPA reads at boot to decide whether to render the topology
5: //! widget. Full RAFT endpoints (`/cluster/raft`, `/cluster/peers`,
6: //! `/cluster/replication`, admin actions) land in phase 4 once the
7: //! identity and prefs paths have been proven end-to-end.
